('112.5.b.10.A',3,'A weather map shows 35°F in one town and 80°F in another town. Which town is warmer?','["the 35°F town", "they are the same", "neither", "the 80°F town"]'::jsonb,3,'80°F is warmer than 35°F.','original'),
